---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import AssessmentList from "../components/AssessmentList";
import UserReview from "../components/UserReview";
---

<Base title="Smart Market Watchlist">
  <main style="max-width: 52rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;">
    <h1>Smart Market Watchlist</h1>
    <p>
      <strong>Steps 0–4.</strong> Three source families travel one path: exchange
      disclosures, market observations, and news → adapter → evidence → extraction →
      grounding → event candidate → linking → corroboration → the Meaningful Change
      Engine → persisted assessment. Your review then selects, from that shared record,
      what changed since <em>you</em> last checked.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.9em;">
      Deliberately unstyled. Corroboration counts independent publishers, not articles.
      Two accounts watching the same company read the same underlying analysis and see
      different reviews, because the window is theirs and the intelligence is not.
    </p>
    <hr />
    <UserReview client:load />
    <hr />
    <h2>All shared intelligence</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 0.9em;">
      Everything the system knows, independent of any account. Two users watching the same
      company share these records and differ only in which of them their own review shows.
    </p>
    <AssessmentList client:load />
  </main>
</Base>
